SURFACE SHAPE (vs the AILifetimeStatsQA 0024 analog)
----------------------------------------------------
AINLDriveSearch is a prompt-input streaming AI surface: withAiFeature('nl-drive-search-replay')
→ AIFeatureCard(title + cyan Helix badge + description + a prompt inputSlot Textarea + the
universal "Ask Helix"/"Helix is thinking…" action) → AiOutputPanel, driven by useAiStream
({ url: '/ai/drives/search', body: { prompt }, onEvent: () => {} }). Unlike the analog it has
NO vehicle scope and NO MaxQuestionChars cap — its only POST field is the free-form `prompt`
and the button gate is purely `canStart = prompt.trim().length > 0` (faithful to the web
source, which sets no maxLength and no aria-label on the Textarea). Verified the feature id +
route exist: internal/api/ai_routes.go L1174 `r.Post("/drives/search", g.Wrap(
"nl-drive-search-replay", driveSearchHandler))` → POST /api/v1/ai/drives/search.

